{"3728550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Game Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3728550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>BUILD THE GAME SHOP OF YOUR DREAMS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own game shop, organize your shelves however you want, satisfy your customers, and turn a small store into your very own gaming empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Design your shop your way.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your interior decoration theme, create a unique atmosphere, and build a game store your customers will never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/a398d0c2ed6dcfd83f4f5af6dd3400a9.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/a398d0c2ed6dcfd83f4f5af6dd3400a9.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/a398d0c2ed6dcfd83f4f5af6dd3400a9.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>You decide how to organize your shop.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place shelves, products, and other items wherever you want and create your store from the ground up. A small and organized shop, or a massive store packed with games? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/977901b8cc5fc3189eace4787dc63e6d.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/977901b8cc5fc3189eace4787dc63e6d.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/977901b8cc5fc3189eace4787dc63e6d.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Your customers' old consoles can break down.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take in old and damaged consoles, repair them, and bring them back to working condition. The better you become at repairing, the more customers you can earn and keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/dab09a8c76a068e7b0f1c4d34080e63e.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/dab09a8c76a068e7b0f1c4d34080e63e.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/dab09a8c76a068e7b0f1c4d34080e63e.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Develop your character as your shop grows.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different skills, make your work easier, and run your shop more efficiently. Choose the abilities that fit your playstyle and create your own path of progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/b628bc5b8308b1ca3de566d5189fec82.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/b628bc5b8308b1ca3de566d5189fec82.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/b628bc5b8308b1ca3de566d5189fec82.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Prepare game orders and ship them to your customers.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your sales, pack the games, and make sure every delivery gets sent on time. As your shop grows, be ready to handle more and more orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Not everything has to be legal... 👀</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack games, bring pirated copies into your shop, and sell them at a lower cost. But remember, your actions may come with consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>You don't have to run the shop alone.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends with <strong>up to 4-player co-op</strong> support. Organize shelves, prepare orders, take care of customers, and grow your shop together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or team up with your friends to build your very own game shop!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>BUILD THE GAME SHOP OF YOUR DREAMS</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own game shop, organize your shelves however you want, satisfy your customers, and turn a small store into your very own gaming empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/2fff51a74b8173cc6ada2a6d4d08147f.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/