ur shop grows, be ready to handle more and more orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e50c4f151a6a32d15acbd9b96c31a417.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Not everything has to be legal... 👀</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack games, bring pirated copies into your shop, and sell them at a lower cost. But remember, your actions may come with consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.poster.avif?t=1787848058\" width=426 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.webm?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728550/extras/e3666887a211a584a4e5338f13df6089.mp4?t=1787848058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>You don't have to run the shop alone.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends with <strong>up to 4-player co-op</strong> support. Organize shelves, prepare orders, take care of customers, and grow your shop together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or team up with your friends to build your very own g